          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>About the data</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>Ask a Manager Salary Survey 2021 (28,089 responses). Cleaned in Python: duplicate responses removed (152), US respondents paid in USD only, salaries limited to $15,000–$1,000,000; 22,576 responses used. Respondents are self-selected readers, so results are not representative of the US workforce.</run>
          </formatted-text>
